    .grid.grid-cols-12.items-center
      .col-span-12.mb-7(class='xl:col-span-7 xl:mb-0')
        .relative(class='max-w-[570px]')
          img.block(
            srcset='assets/images/homepage-4-follower.png 2x',
            alt='Follower',
            class='rounded-t-[500px]'
          )
          .absolute.bottom-10.hero-thumb-animation.w-20.h-20(
            class='z-[3] sm:w-fit sm:h-fit right-[-10px] sm:right-[-80px]'
          )
            img(src='assets/images/homepage-2-certify-1.svg', alt='Certify')
      .col-span-12(class='xl:col-span-5')
        +FlexCol(class='xl:max-w-[570px]')
          +TagButton('Branding').mb-2
          +Heading3('Build your brand and reach out to social followers').mb-3
          p.text-base.text-gray-400.font-medium.mb-5 Sharing content online allows you to craft an online persona that reflects your personal values and professional skills. Even if you only use social media occasionally, what you create, share or react to feeds into this public narrative. How you conduct yourself online is now just as important as your behavior offline especially when it comes to your digital marketing career.
          ul.grid.grid-cols-1(class='gap-y-[18px] sm:grid-cols-2 mb-[68px]')
            +FeatureManagementItem('Send & Schedule Posts')
            +FeatureManagementItem('Live Chat Request')
            +FeatureManagementItem('Push Notification')
            +FeatureManagementItem('Create fully integrated campaigns')
            +FeatureManagementItem('Online Visitors')
            +FeatureManagementItem('Directly send or schedule posts')
          +ItemsCenter.gap-6
            +NormalButton('Download App')
            +RightArrowButton('Learn More', '#')
    .border-b.border-third-brand(class='py-[71px] lg:py-[142px]')
      +TrustedWorldSection
    +Heading2('What We Offer').text-center.mb-6(class='mt-[69px] lg:mt-[138px]')
    +Heading6('What makes us different from others? We give holistic solutions with strategy, design & technology.').mx-auto.text-center(
      class='max-w-[550px] mb-[63px]'
    )
    .grid.grid-cols-1(class='gap-[30px] mb-[63px] xl:grid-cols-2')
      +StrategyDesignItem('assets/images/page/homepage4/offer1.png', 'Manage budgets and resources', 'Seamless importing and round-tripping of Microsoft Project plans, Excel files & CSV files.', '#')
      +StrategyDesignItem('assets/images/page/homepage4/offer2.png', 'Employee Assessments', 'What makes us different from others? We give holistic solutions with strategy, design & technology.', '#')
      +StrategyDesignItem('assets/images/page/homepage4/offer3.png', 'Smart Installation Tools', 'No lag time, no lost effort when priorities change, no email black hole. As team collaboration improves', '#')
      +StrategyDesignItem('assets/images/page/homepage4/offer4.png', 'Collaborative to the core.', 'Share updates instantly within our project management software, and get the entire team collaborating', '#')
      +StrategyDesignItem('assets/images/page/homepage4/offer5.png', 'Manage budgets and resources', 'Seamless importing and round-tripping of Microsoft Project plans, Excel files & CSV files.', '#')
      +StrategyDesignItem('assets/images/page/homepage4/offer6.png', 'Unlimited ways to work', 'What makes us different from others? We give holistic solutions with strategy, design & technology.', '#')
    +JustifyCenter.gap-6
      +NormalButton('Download App')
      +RightArrowButton('Learn More', '#')
